i don't know if i'm the only one but if  there's a dog in a game  you've pretty much won me over that's  why in no particular order  we're checking out some of the very best  most goodest dogs in games  that deserve all the belly rubs and  praise  and if you're looking for even more  content to make your tail wag then  be sure to subscribe and slide on over  to our channel  come on zagrius is stronger than i could  ever be because if i had a cerberus at  home  i don't think i could leave without him  the giant  red three-headed dog may be guarding the  gates of hell  but he's still incredibly adorable and  always  always sue the salt of my failed runs  i also gave serb way more gifts than  were necessary but  i think we can all agree it was the  right thing to do  gta 5 is popular for many reasons  but you already know why it's here chop  the most loyal pup who rides shotgun  with me everywhere i go  being able to play fetch having his help  in certain missions  and even running around as chop are some  of my favorite things in gta 5  and easily grant him a spot on this list  my absolute favorite doggo guitarist kk  slider  based on animal crossing's very own  composer kazumitotaka  kk is known for his smooth tunes and  sharing the joy of music with the  townsfolk in  every iteration of animal crossing if  you haven't heard the live version of kk  house yet  be sure to request it the next time he's  playing at your island  parappa the rapper might be on a quest  for sonny funny's heart  but he definitely won mine long ago he  also showed me how little rhythm i truly  have but  the iconic paper thin pup is sure to  stir up your nostalgia  and make you want to play again from the  beanie and baggy jeans to reminding me  that i gotta believe  parappa is definitely a very good boy  [Music]  the mischievous sun goddess amaterasu  shines her light on this list  as she's one of the best canines when it  comes to both satisfying combat and  painting skills  okami is brimming with wonderful dogs  because we can never forget about the  kusa 5.  i love seeing the various breeds in  action and respect the fact that they  needed a good ol butt weapon to get  their motivation back  which ami happily provided  watching didi go from rough stray pup to  refined diamond dog  gets me a little bit sentimental but  that slow-mo shot of deedee  jumping into the chopper with snake for  the first time still  sends chills down my spine  the grizzly dog with his strikingly  familiar eye patch  is definitely one of the very best boys  who can 81 missions  help you scout out nearby items and  people and make you feel  really bad for being gone too long with  extra enthusiastic greetings  [Music]  curry mario from the presonus series is  a very intelligent albino shiba inu  outfitted with a custom evoker who loves  to go on walks and play at the shrine  for many players coromaru has a  confirmed spot on the team during battle  no matter the stats he's also based on  the real-life dog hachiko who remained  loyal to his owner even after they  passed away which makes me just want to  hug them both  so tightly right now manella's trusty  australian shepherd angelo has some of  the most  smile inducing limit breaks i've ever  seen  ranoa impulsively bought angelo from a  puppy store without telling her father  and the rest is history she fights  alongside renault and helps keep the  rest of the party in good shape while  she's at it  [Music]  it doesn't get much better than having a  dog accompany you  while helping you find goodies like gold  coins and power moons but  it does if they're wearing a hat  and when it comes to that very specific  criteria super mario odyssey  absolutely delivers the moon kingdom  really takes it to another level  by replacing the dog's hat with a space  helmet and giving him a chance to leave  gloriously in zero g  [Music]  literally the epitome of a good boy  boomerang's life goal  is to destroy all the bad guys after  they killed his family  boomer's revenge turns into your gain as  he helps you in and out of combat  can bring you back a gun from an enemy  he's taken out can tag nearby enemies  and require some good pets from time to  time  side note far cry 6 might be delayed but  my  undying love for chirizo is still very  much on time  [Music]  both dogme and river the characters  actor  deserve all the recognition they receive  dogmeat has been one of everyone's  favorite companions in the fallout  series by being a powerful aide in  combat  and river has even received an award for  top video game dog of 2015.  it's so wholesome to see how proud river  looks next to her trophy  [Music]  wall is the helpful doberman pinscher  from valiant hearts that solves puzzles  with you  and can be used as the ultimate  distraction against guards because  of course no one can resist a cute  little pupper  walt's powerful cuteness can even make  players avoid  certain bomb ridden areas to ensure his  safety  he has a doggo after all so sometimes he  can end up in a little danger chasing  after food  [Music]  the dog from fable 2 is as loyal as they  come  since they've stuck by your side since  you saved them from a bully  the dog helps the hero with various  things throughout the story like combat  and treasure  but if you equip your dog with a collar  you can view its opinion  of you but don't worry its love for you  will always be maxed  in the see the future dlc pack you could  even change the breed of your dog to be  a dalmatian  a bloodhound a husky or a mutt with  different variants to come later  based on the hero's good or evil  alignment  [Music]  while all of calico is filled with  amazing and magical cats  dogs and other animals i had to have a  corgi on this list  ranger is the adorable corgi from calico  and with the big small potion you can  shrink ranger or any animal  to a size where you can wear them on  your head while you complete quests  or make them grow to a size where you  can mount and ride them to travel  quickly and i can confirm ranger is  ridiculously cute in all sizes  [Music]  up next we got one of the beefiest boys  on the list  the mubari hound from dragon age is a  tough chunky companion who is ready to  square up against  any armored foes especially now that  he's imprinted on you  for saving his life in a side quest so  by saving a life  you've gained a friend for life as the  hound fights with you for the remainder  of the game  [Music]  dog from super mario odyssey isn't the  only mario dog worth mentioning  you might be thinking chain chomp but  we're throwing the recognition to good  ol poochie this time  poochie has been a yoshi ally for many  years starting with yoshi's island  kuchi is just a big ball of cute and if  you need proof then i'll just kindly  point you to  poochie and yoshi's woolly world  you're welcome all right spoiler alert  for anybody  who still has silent hill 2 on their  backlog a super secret  and specific ending can be unlocked that  is probably  one of the greatest ones of all time  after all the insanity and madness that  you go through  you are finally confronted with the  mastermind behind it all  ushiba inu it's hard to believe an  animal so  cute was behind something so terrifying  but  i prefer that over the alternatives  [Music]  if we're being real every single dog in  every game  falls in my personal best dog category  but if your favorite wasn't mentioned  then let us know in the comments below  and if this video made you happier than  a dog with two tails  then be sure to leave a like and come  back soon for even more  daily gaming content see ya  [Music]  you
 

